& [P5BoundaryImportAndRuntimeObligationInventoryV1] is the P5-S01 boundary import and runtime obligation inventory
  + [slice_id] is P5-S01
  + [slice_name] is boundary import and runtime obligation inventory
  + [model_route_used] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [model_route_depth] is deeper_reasoning_required
  + [model_route_reason] is boundary import decides which runtime obligations become P5 authority and which remain plan-only support
  + [inventory_result] is runtime_obligations_imported_without_runtime_implementation
  + [next_gate_result] is P5-S02 may open
  + [dependency_installation_authorized] is false
  + [package_metadata_mutation_authorized] is false
  + [implementation_code_authorized] is false
  + [adapter_implementation_authorized] is false
  + [transport_implementation_authorized] is false
  + [UI_implementation_authorized] is false
  + [graph_runtime_execution_authorized] is false
  + [command_execution_beyond_validation_authorized] is false
  + [process_control_authorized] is false
  + [GPU_control_authorized] is false
  + [model_runtime_mutation_authorized] is false
  + [job_dispatch_authorized] is false
  + [assignment_authorized] is false
  + [dispatch_authorized] is false
  + [operations_control_authorized] is false
  + [live_machine_control_authorized] is false

  = must: treat this inventory as P5 planning authority only
  = must: preserve SOP source, canonical specifications, proof ledgers, generated outputs, graph checkpoints, surface projections, packet candidates, assignment records, dispatch records, operations decisions, and live-control deferrals as distinct authority classes
  = must: open graph state and checkpoint nonauthority only after this inventory is accepted by completion review

& [P5ImportedAuthorityObligationSet] is the accepted authority obligation set imported by P5-S01
  + [imported_obligation] is P2 record identity, natural keys, authority states, freshness rules, source/projection distinction, stale review, blocked review, contradiction review, and schema validation boundaries
  + [imported_obligation] is P3 operator envelope, operator input and output authority basis, refusal semantics, trace identity, deterministic duty boundaries, nonautomation boundary, and support-readiness recomputation
  + [imported_obligation] is P8 proof ledger required fields, evaluation result states, accepted absence proof, stale/rebake rules, generated-output nonpromotion, negative oracle cases, and downstream consumption gates
  + [imported_obligation] is P4 packetization no-assignment no-dispatch and no-live-effect boundaries as inherited through P8 readiness
  + [imported_obligation] is IR7 and IR8 dry-run and manager proof nonpromotion boundaries as inherited through P8 proof inputs

  = must: require every future graph state, node transition, interrupt, proof trace, and completion review to cite the imported obligation class it satisfies
  = must: mark P5 downstream slices stale when any imported authority obligation changes

& [P5RuntimeAuthorityClassInventory] is the runtime authority class inventory
  + [authority_class] is SOP_source_authority
  + [authority_class] is canonical_specification_authority
  + [authority_class] is kernel_record_authority
  + [authority_class] is operator_contract_authority
  + [authority_class] is proof_ledger_authority
  + [authority_class] is graph_checkpoint_runtime_state
  + [authority_class] is graph_transition_trace
  + [authority_class] is generated_output_trace
  + [authority_class] is surface_projection
  + [authority_class] is packet_candidate
  + [authority_class] is human_judgment_handoff
  + [authority_class] is assignment_record
  + [authority_class] is dispatch_record
  + [authority_class] is operations_record
  + [authority_class] is live_control_deferral

  = must: keep graph_checkpoint_runtime_state, graph_transition_trace, generated_output_trace, surface_projection, packet_candidate, human_judgment_handoff, assignment_record, dispatch_record, operations_record, and live_control_deferral non-authoritative unless separate accepted source authority elevates the class
  = must: reject any graph checkpoint, transition trace, generated output, surface projection, packet candidate, dry-run result, or displayed human approval as source authority

& [P5RuntimeObligationFamilyMatrix] is the runtime obligation family matrix
  + [obligation_family] is graph_state_envelope
  + [owning_slice] is P5-S02
  + [required_input_authority] is P2 record identity, P3 operator envelope, and P8 proof ledger boundaries
  + [obligation_family] is checkpoint_nonauthority_and_resume
  + [owning_slice] is P5-S02
  + [required_input_authority] is P8 generated-output nonpromotion and stale/rebake rules
  + [obligation_family] is operator_node_mapping
  + [owning_slice] is P5-S03
  + [required_input_authority] is P3 operator contracts and P2 kernel record authority
  + [obligation_family] is deterministic_transition_records
  + [owning_slice] is P5-S03
  + [required_input_authority] is P3 trace identity, refusal semantics, and P8 proof ledger states
  + [obligation_family] is SOP_interrupt_and_human_handoff
  + [owning_slice] is P5-S04
  + [required_input_authority] is P2 ambiguity/contradiction states, P3 refusal semantics, and P8 rebake rules
  + [obligation_family] is runtime_proof_trace_fixtures
  + [owning_slice] is P5-S05
  + [required_input_authority] is P8 proof ledger, no-live-effect, no-dispatch, and nonpromotion contracts
  + [obligation_family] is adapter_dependency_and_activation
  + [owning_slice] is P5-S06
  + [required_input_authority] is dependency posture, proof trace plan, implementation activation requirements, and no package metadata mutation boundary
  + [obligation_family] is P5_completion_and_downstream_gate
  + [owning_slice] is P5-S07
  + [required_input_authority] is accepted P5-S01 through P5-S06 completion reviews

  = must: keep each family dependency-closed inside its owning slice after upstream acceptance
  = must: reject downstream work that depends on a family before the owning slice completion review accepts it

