& [P5S01DownstreamGate] is the gate opened by P5-S01
  + [opened_slice] is P5-S02 graph procedure state envelope and checkpoint nonauthority contract
  + [activation_basis] is runtime obligation inventory accepted
  + [model_route] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [model_route_reason] is graph checkpoint state can preserve execution continuity but cannot become semantic authority or proof authority
  + [completion_review_required] is true

  = must: open P5-S02 only after P5-S01 completion review accepts this boundary import and runtime obligation inventory
